From 1db9df95821319d81bad91e1caeb890b8fa37231 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 01:45:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Wire up placeholder controls: attachments, model picker,
 version history, publish/share

- assistant.ts: accept explicit model override, add GET /api/assistant/models,
  route image attachments to a vision-capable Groq model with proper
  multimodal message content
- publish.ts (new): in-memory publish/play store backing real Share/Publish
  flows (POST /api/publish, GET /api/play/:slug)
- KilnApp.jsx: wire up paperclip/camera attach with thumbnail preview,
  drag/drop/paste image support on the chat input, wand2 'clean context'
  confirmation modal, history icon opens real version-history modal backed
  by snapshots taken on every applied edit, ember dropdown becomes a real
  Groq model picker, Share/Publish header buttons open working modals,
  avatar menu shows real session usage instead of fake credits, fullscreen
  button uses the real Fullscreen API on the preview pane
